{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10013_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b5364dfaafd5a9a906b6fcda4925ddca56fb15475c9b01cf0b5cddbfd9f6dcf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:267c18cc6e3d870195e4bce45be0e22b7378198c6c9c0231eb2d2a1739c6c426",
      "text": "选定道路的前方",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4975259e6af17d50ddfe1044a2ca962d4f01aa12837c525659cfbe3b77ee66b",
      "text": "DRAMATIC STARS决定出演电视剧。\n内容是为自己的现状而烦恼的三名青梅竹马，\n穿越时空回到了过去。\n随着拍摄的推进，他们逐渐与\n各自饰演的角色产生了共鸣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000020:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000020:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:267c18cc6e3d870195e4bce45be0e22b7378198c6c9c0231eb2d2a1739c6c426",
      "text": "选定道路的前方",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e45c045cd938edcb79efc81e13d5a6fda4cd850df80dd8e2071ec739d6d170f1",
      "text": "“糟了，都这个时间了！\n想看的电视节目要开始了。快回去吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9334cb6c09b97ded15befb4a53f9169498f2d33cd66db45401d5ca351de578e2",
      "text": "“……原来我们也有过那样的时期啊。\n真怀念啊”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85fc3d003f0ac7b988b6fa92ff56c9fefe1c92c130ce63f50890f5b51a3fc88d",
      "text": "“唉——为什么小孩子\n非得长大不可呢”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc26938091b2579caca8ca0c11469154b9c3a826d8602ec2e18fbc8514b67bd5",
      "text": "“就算变成了大人，你说的这些话\n好像和小时候也没什么区别吧？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e65bd7b3fcd46a40d5d72720e459603532a1afb43a442d08bb8890086ec42c5",
      "text": "“刚才不就已经证明了吗”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f63e338a9fae446f20ae3d105f2318d7c4d921eff8749a1d9931f4bd94dd5f65",
      "text": "“…………”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cce94f402d8d4ce91448a918f3ddaa8b97ae25c40f23332bcd1d7fecc9c16e3",
      "text": "“……喂，\n我们该不会是来到过去了吧？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00c4130160e9d1390ced805c2119084c5d6b028f9b6467f3bddcc5b7be20b913",
      "text": "“说不定是谁做的一场梦呢。\n不过作为梦境，倒也未免太真实了些”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2fd9556fcb5ff55873a1cca4e4be4adb83b3c1b80342179516472f1a1e7f539",
      "text": "“开玩笑的吧。虽说之前确实跟你们抱怨过，\n现实太辛苦了、好想回到小时候……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_a:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f416e7692dde196cd47872e929ba71f7da8e1994b2a9bd9d229ae2ae151f7734",
      "text": "“但难道真的，回到过去了啊……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "数月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1774d3ed6a7cba6b56224e0fb94ade8854826c650dd6b0e5d4858e80e051d90",
      "text": "DRAMATIC STARS全员出演电视剧吗。\n哇，太厉害了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfb1d24b9f14b3332418412547a4ef9ef85c0846149ab9b22e3077af52a0016d",
      "text": "是的！这份就是电视剧的企划书。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de9f951bc93592f6f672fdf12095df65c30df1d3b29e5c3a0a1fd3d78e05ac7d",
      "text": "多谢啦！我瞧瞧……\n我们要扮演的是3人青梅竹马组啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7eb4b0a980930576c230bcc59f35142da73f834fbb9a66b7fa9a0dba0a45561",
      "text": "上面写着，这是为了如今的自己而烦恼的3个人，\n穿越时空回到过去的故事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a4dd261704fd8301a4860bbb490147906fe198311c7eb0884e55d9e9ee142e6",
      "text": "哦哦，特摄英雄的变身腰带\n竟然是穿越时空的道具吗！听上去真有意思！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dc10d9fa1e874341dc1a13dbf9d7fd7876443482058b09b78c883fb7c5de2dd",
      "text": "特摄英雄吗……没怎么接触过呢。\n制作人，能麻烦你准备一些参考资料吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99e9baf65b9c91e0e56d7e3061e5f199d0061e012328ba7da5d1d8068a682547",
      "text": "那样的话，来我家怎么样？\n我家有各种各样特摄片的DVD哦。翼也来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:141772cce6c43c20e7fcd8ba8fd61d46ab3012bdfd0d7d85bb15e3061daf5802",
      "text": "……这次也有玩英雄扮演游戏的场景呢。\n资料自然是越多越好。那就去天道家吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1d37ba0d0172bf2004441d209005684357099980c9cb498f4c3e8323559f00e",
      "text": "辉先生，非常感谢！那我就恭敬不如从命，\n也去打扰啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94a069852c2736c3f5418fcb7a97e6ca4e066b578008203149f6de1a7eff487f",
      "text": "好，那就这么定了。下下周左右怎么样？\n大家正好都休假吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf7c2308696cd6098bf56e349acc622fffd55a5d657c0fec4b7b69a0f0bb5911",
      "text": "剧本差不多也正好在那个时候送达哦。\n如果大家要聚在一起，需要直接寄到辉先生家里吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1759e47082d78256e69cd3dcddca405b681725822488688492ac797d8d729d1d",
      "text": "哎呀，那样的话就能顺便讨论剧本了呢。\n对了！●●●●プロデューサー也来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1960fd9485137ad3f654c8760bdf575263c54e978250be26468759fb8554c790",
      "text": "当然，前提是日程有空啦。\n你考虑看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf918635bd2ddc66033e4b372bcb85a758f465aab0fbade5fd902302e01f490d",
      "text": "辉的家中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15890cc7004906a9674a3e29ec813742dd0a90801c93307f33e54b7da83f6323",
      "text": "唔～果然英雄登场的场景，\n简直帅呆了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:049af3bc67b38186d72684a480313bbcfbc8ce35c66b2a9dc33a8d675b7cb8b4",
      "text": "小时候，我可崇拜特摄英雄了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d39ab9dca3db0f12caa08c24b7a2642f24dfe0b06f5f267b78faab56d6f58d3d",
      "text": "看你现在也没什么两样就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8e71cc31a7abc231d4f72ac487cbce08290eca586961585a87ab393dce64662",
      "text": "呵呵，很有辉先生的风格呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a324fa8e6ff932b8bbbf49d9f6dddc08a71863cfa7f8d359a69600e81cb8825",
      "text": "仿佛能想象出辉先生小时候的样子呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0da9415947d9762fa80840e3a6bbf9545ec012fc445166e124c4c7eda6ada68",
      "text": "（而我从小崇拜的对象，一直都是父亲呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9f479108d80fda1f9e1d39d5de30d0e8e8ebb4adb6b6ba440249d383364f83c",
      "text": "总之，这类作品似乎也能让\n一部分成年人为之着迷。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:616d266d6cf93b8c0096bbe2676eb28c7f95967b933b808bb9968ab9cf9b413e",
      "text": "今后如果还有机会，我也想继续接这类工作。\n最重要的是，电视工作的反响非常大。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dd06cfc22c1ff0e95d1542b29d3a5e695e17262efa3d679a8f519fe87451b53",
      "text": "毕竟靠特摄剧走红的演员，\n数量非常多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30122dfa473613f7d047230e9fb36cd1a85127b06ac3ebfad6260252dbb50d1b",
      "text": "受众也不仅仅是小孩子，\n还包括了他们的家人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:362661840f99e40a7616536e2d7ef2dfff8e83a97c323e5a808d8f6c84a902cb",
      "text": "确实，经常能看到小时候在电视里看的英雄，\n活跃在其他电视剧或电影里的身影呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8599d05f177252963f4a2803df9edee942ddfb8a2da2b8c310148b054ec28431",
      "text": "也是啊，特摄片常被称为演员的龙门嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3bd70af2692fb5c3d0fd2ff6f61a3ccc3c1dd43c8b43564b3710df72390497b",
      "text": "要是哪天我们的表现得到认可，\n也能收到特摄片的邀约，那就太棒了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce883d8c4244a063c03d00cc0070aa3849ffcee52ac33c81f8c8790cedc3f486",
      "text": "是啊。先不论是不是龙门，\n为了哪天能接到这样的工作，一起努力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ae96d515f969ea5db35b2e1cd2f6f7684163f33707a573e175bc7d06dcdbb4e",
      "text": "结合刚才看的这些，来核对剧本吧。\n以后的事情，等在这份工作中拿到好评之后再说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5963fe0a1e6b77dce5eb66dd63961a44a2170b786af8cba95c5c1a7be500c49",
      "text": "今天是剧本围读。\n那么，我们这就开始吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43",
      "text": "请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:892acb24e864e7d92a9219595b3e1a8b2632c9aed7751ae449604d4f2deddec0",
      "text": "“虽然搞不懂为什么会穿越时空，\n但肯定是有什么原因的吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95d92ec33588e2fb3e8c3ee5150e0018495c9c2a353c98add362206283b70728",
      "text": "“原因……\n这种不可思议的现象，真的会有所谓的理由吗”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c49cf3cce0be102f319aaa51a993cce623e022c7764caf07636b03cce02079",
      "text": "“对我来说什么理由都无所谓。\n只要能再次回到那个时候……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bafe7767b6d42d04e5027cd57b1d86fdb9bd04b111a2ebfea41e8c104e40f65f",
      "text": "（我饰演的优支，因为在教育实习中犯了错，\n放弃了成为教师的梦想。……嘴上是这么说的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:805a32cb989ac8497fc3336dff5bd2c125be04d31e0262206e6dd60a91fe0537",
      "text": "（但其实，内心深处一直无法放下梦想。\n一路走来，心里一定非常痛苦吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:576b6e6bcaad5f9ec9bc2b483d9a407c1efdea9f41ad9832f920285124f36de2",
      "text": "（因为放弃梦想，是一件无比痛苦的事情）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000130:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f34502d7b46a33cf8466947285ef889c58aeec50e6fa7aa344aae0d8ffee0349",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n因为想和你说说话，就忍不住打电话过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000133:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b6461d6dbbac0d4d85fb2a90eb948e097b65ea4e9871f443bb339d9bace4857",
      "text": "围读剧本之后，\n我脑子里就一直在想着优支的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000135:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02b86e4fd1e0137fa1c880394c622262df54d477585ed30480113b3f55daaa54",
      "text": "有时心情甚至会被他牵着走……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000137:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6da096e0750d136d9da3be1c4350fee5951916c9232cd08dcbb8dc4583620ab",
      "text": "因为剧本对心情的描写\n很细腻呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000140:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45c2b6ebc880e1a32aece5e55b4706daadfe6d3f37568bd4abd20634820a924c",
      "text": "是啊，\n所以可能才特别容易产生共鸣吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000142:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bbfd67626415af755cef6e08cf036a45fced41c8abe8ca7c3612003d33889b5",
      "text": "登场人物之间的关系，\n不知为何也和我们有些相似呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000144:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb516a7be5b0641801849226f835a4d1bef56cefc95d594ca2b84c8a7c0e041b",
      "text": "我刚才还和辉先生他们聊到，\n这次选中我们，或许也是因为这个原因吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000146:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9391353fca69f5a171261e7b1529c556d914f73f15c2e63e7984fd8054179a55",
      "text": "为了能让大家觉得这个角色非我莫属，\n我会加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000148:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7e02e4896bc5f9098fc359faef189951e21b1d1b17f944d391ca79f65c64ba0",
      "text": "通过今天的围读，\n我也理解了优支的立场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000150:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b82391a31b82ed0693ff9caa055ccf835283b1ab1cfae83dc876622fdbb01c17",
      "text": "在正式开拍之前，\n我会把剧本研读得更透彻一些的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_d:cmd-000152:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31c83d9eaabd90537cd2654d3858b6049b710e5e76df00af3366fa153cf47735",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢你听我倾诉。\n那就先这样了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c62e789af920965799c66b9dc406a4bf1566acd569216dc2f56f34cf56ac683",
      "text": "“这个谜一样的摆设是什么啊……\n真不愧是笃志的老家，居然会有这种东西”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63aea7929323a03b365233571056896bedcf2356174df88a82d50e8a196cdbaf",
      "text": "“喂，笃志。这边的东西，\n我就随便收在一块儿了啊。都是可以扔掉的吧？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0606cf1d1465f76b8cb38ff29e57878e116b49004c0b9379cfa7a2217ed850a4",
      "text": "“哦！\n你们两个，今天真多谢了啊”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17a0cec51d1287f8965b4549e7d3a3bfb5e6c4a46b39ea652e4d4b1335aeca91",
      "text": "“老爸老妈给了我饭钱。\n等弄完这些，我们3个去喝一杯吧！我请客！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97fea3cd2370c2b1645d8afd6dd2114f760899248b37020e367cbdb3a210ba44",
      "text": "“那是当然的。要不是这样，\n谁会特意跑来帮你收拾东西啊”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3af0eb72b7737083483f83484cfb0b5fcb5079d6f76ef02d48037854fa8af2ab",
      "text": "“哎呀？这条腰带是……？\n笃志，翻出了这么个东西呢”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d6960b9c42896c34dfdd29866ab790555cbf6654d4a98ab2b9fd8cce9ff3f9d",
      "text": "“哇，好怀念！这不是变身腰带吗！\n以前经常拿这个玩呢。借我戴一下”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0bebfda97e5365eb998427b31337f2c7795a7b04048ddc02dff96ac941a0d5e",
      "text": "“装备！星光变身！红色！\n在暮色中分外耀眼的……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8719b93b551065c93b8a21ec5047f877f5ea577dc79fc3d979f66ec8bd2c444b",
      "text": "“哇啊！？\n怎么回事，腰带在发光，好刺眼……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d1c22c90c74343359f706a8418ff93bf0fbf466bfeba47ed50fe77dfe6008ae",
      "text": "“这里是……？该不会是，\n小时候我们3个经常一起玩的……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:736bf45ec65de5c1c5cd1eca797c4f9156371435ba4ca81bbf5dd567c87fa053",
      "text": "“笃志，你到底干了什么！？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68f4ddc30d397aa9dc04c22e441d49d080142a4ad7d2ae3760b818c26f4671f1",
      "text": "“我只是念了变身台词而已啊！\n……等等，咦？腰带不见了？？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_e:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a18cfd6bc833efe4803d09bdefe0269f35d52f890fcaf8ae8f0a4124cda18bc4",
      "text": "“装备！星光变身！红色！\n在暮色中分外耀眼的一号星，参上！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66eb65994b277b15df32a399b2cb59bae15dbfb036f19c02aabc94a2fe8d6572",
      "text": "“还要继续玩英雄游戏啊～\n真玩不腻呢”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f1420108a24990efd9ece27c442877a00bb088393143628b0d081d5470905e",
      "text": "“因为笃志最喜欢英雄了嘛”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02d066e367dfabbbda76acc32661df60d24f02800cbc5e9917a13eb986d65c46",
      "text": "“那当然！\n等长大以后，我可是要成为英雄的！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f9f001862185e91e227aa74efb7621e70ca199a494957954819442f1fdfa575",
      "text": "“你们两个也有想成为的目标吧？\n会变成什么样的大人呢，我现在就好期待啊！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89083393fe9ddec69484b3fc0b6af40e6058630e8aa41da166f9d18ddd188f18",
      "text": "“这副景象，我隐约有点印象……\n在那里的，是我们吧？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f4c66ea45320e0368de1a7617e793996fec71538aedf0f2f35d96ad95fe84e0",
      "text": "“恐怕是的……在我身边，直到那个年纪\n还在玩英雄游戏的也就只有笃志了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac8e299ae09dc2a089173ac602ad3e45ffc7bfab0c3dd0d2aed40a7b6cb07a5",
      "text": "“那是因为我足够喜欢啊！\n好嘞，我去确认一下。喂——！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5916d10d18932b80255793512ece12a4633b4f7e4ade96bf4e8b57bc38148b92",
      "text": "“嗯？你谁啊，大叔”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46dd52a5b1917397082d3ae1e527a3ea58f58a70d708ac765358959346bf5482",
      "text": "“才不是大叔！不对，话说你那条变身腰带\n好帅啊。那么老旧的款式，亏你能弄到啊？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22cab090e91421d6b293edcaec16aa8eb43b27a641b36a43328d62465e318398",
      "text": "“哈啊？你在说什么呢。\n现在电视里正播着呢好不好。才一点都不老旧呢！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e45c045cd938edcb79efc81e13d5a6fda4cd850df80dd8e2071ec739d6d170f1",
      "text": "“糟了，都这个时间了！\n想看的电视节目要开始了。快回去吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5adc520aa331db80ddae087e4616e0a33a219c7e5f3614f08c8d4a5b5c73b586",
      "text": "“是啊。你们两个，\n作业还没做完吧？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0f48a0811f5d8eef6f65262ddfd635408a7828ae10c4d7868da557d802acd3c",
      "text": "“哇呃。圣士的说教又要开始了！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da52d056db9958cf14ed12a3020009ee785f6fff728d0e8ccb74e361077cc35e",
      "text": "“听到了吗。管那个长得很像圣士的小鬼，\n叫圣士了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea596fb2c777f51211a923b3ee320dd0ceddf3103b316f72b4dca8b84ed673c2",
      "text": "“……那帮家伙毫无疑问，就是小时候的我们”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_g:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "数周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78affef7b39f4dba46e735419f46db1390066161ea6288bbb6dff0a369223815",
      "text": "拍摄进展得也很顺利呢。\n差不多已经拍完一半左右了吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0e823afcb64691fb54d75943b7bca329c016e70d519192841179d47e18ab71e",
      "text": "（话说回来，越是去演，\n就越觉得我和笃志之间有很多相似之处啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:176748d35993543de8ce7cecabe5050f629205b0f0a6de6be0731751f7084feb",
      "text": "（最明显的就是从小就喜欢特摄英雄这一点。\n除此之外……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_g:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d631077396eb47ec79d561f68b8ae61ac31d0859e2158324046d220818e2182f",
      "text": "（一直追寻着自己的梦想，到了长大后，\n却撞上了不得不放弃的残酷现实……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_g:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d7fcec955b5260dd707403f26d3b4001687876065a57dbfe9bd776d1e50d7ce",
      "text": "（要是我没能遇到制作人的话……\n恐怕到现在都还在那家酒吧里胡乱发牢骚吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05ce2f2455f7861dafc2b6e88c2819d2f57eae81d9281d13210b41a87f735687",
      "text": "（……要是小时候的我看到了现在的我，\n会怎么想呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_g:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8508a4ffa317c40077f3a93da1a87c9bcc023b9ab4d6bd5b82a5409be38804a",
      "text": "（现在的我在当偶像，\n他会觉得我很帅气吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_g:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93b3576ebcbb5f40d050c95fb2e1c97c6ff1888d14301b473fcdf55457262d38",
      "text": "（……不对。为了能让他觉得我很帅气，\n我必须朝着梦想一直奔跑下去才对！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_g:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95758d1098288cdef042f6394281deeed101a84da22d153c480821620d5370c6",
      "text": "天道先生，请就位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_g:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e24846dc04bd950e3e5abb4031496a77c87b00b6cff6fc3038124d8f479767d9",
      "text": "好的！马上就来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e04fd2b00f71ec660109839dd3e8454eedb45a9c2686ea7d7706bf808e3003b0",
      "text": "笃志等人的母校",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfa211e98599aeeb11ee4665a1d6d3e2edd294b5dda8346d4c14c2564ac15d1e",
      "text": "“大叔，你认识笃志吗？笃志在\n我遇到困难的时候，可是第一个跑来帮我的哦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfd6a50ef47c5653df2a9f572ad66a02098504962c6656ed9230687d4c987c17",
      "text": "“那个时候真是帅呆了。\n我觉得他将来绝对能成为英雄！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000035:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d3b26656c0e268a871e531452b38a8b12a27d798bde59302dcca2abc500deac",
      "text": "经常玩耍的公园",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c896e927c31cb1c87fb277de55e5c5207ec13bc24587fbe687cad0264c32cd79",
      "text": "“虽然大家总说我们性格不同，\n但和笃志还有优支待在一起就很开心”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80f6e1bbfcca256a6f4657c4aeb910db8e35eb7dc316080da2fe32b3777de443",
      "text": "“我觉得就算长成了大人，只要有他们两个在，\n无论发生什么我都不会害怕”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000051:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab6cb61fd50efe0ed3fc59adc132982346e8bf2a86473dadb48b575bc3bf49c6",
      "text": "充满回忆的教室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c653023021535a88b4f8da90dc79231850341bebd20542d19b9ed1c6d4eafb4",
      "text": "“优支是个为朋友着想的温柔孩子哦。\n教别人东西也很在行”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa61893f357d52c6ed82acff17cefb5626a6a53fa74247959f6d13c35fc27dc9",
      "text": "“如果是他的话，一定能成为好老师的。\n真让人期待他的未来呢”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eeca18abbe5af67f1e320d702249be76a9b283030950e892b4a122cf116fe2e",
      "text": "“……我说啊。\n我曾无数次想过，要是能回到小时候就好了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8374a09640644b2171b04a0c6ccc27b9969dc9e87cfaded97e9afb37e9bfc011",
      "text": "“想着要是能多用功读书、抹掉实习时的失误，\n把我的人生重新翻修一番该有多好”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cb50ba65edd82af1c4d6947d6955cae157c9222821072e0a799d8143efda1ce",
      "text": "“是啊。\n我们3个聚在一起时，经常会聊起这个呢”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc7d6bedb5e774e9c360e4ef185120c482e7409cdb5b585a05a7ec52c6b99a77",
      "text": "“但是，真的回来之后我才发觉。\n这里所拥有的一切，我一样都不想改变”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c57a339453f8cedb5169e3be9bb41c265ffce2da9138ece57c5f29b5439a8177",
      "text": "“遇见的人，听到后让人开心的话。\n全部都在闪闪发光……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:379e9c8b19aeb08f795cba06f679f98d89d49db2029933c51ebeff32bf634ddc",
      "text": "“因为这些都是支撑着我一路走来的、最重要的宝物”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3703ec1ba342b0d3726aca69bd6baec2d24999216063260b16ca3eb5cfba2fc3",
      "text": "“……你们，真的想要回到原本的世界吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_h:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45ac5d1f74ab9b64c81b4a76a218368b724742591d9fc3747d3d37219f59dba0",
      "text": "“回去之后，可就又要面对\n那满是烦恼的现实了哦？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bffd9cfe99743822f183713fc24fdfac31c816735c896a2f87dfbd600d3e3001",
      "text": "拍完下一个镜头，就正式杀青了啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:741ff0f42f9edd9955632e16b4dc6b039e2d374418e3e96ad1b2fa3e4cb122bb",
      "text": "一想到这就是最后了，还真有点舍不得呢。\n要是能回到过去，从头再拍一遍就好了～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9bd12e15a0d6206882bd096f53eae6aa788bb0a7a575a1f1209d5a52c5e7193",
      "text": "你入戏太深了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e303fd731a4978bd47bf69e8e70393c14ddb8f5a24df7321d9a7bed45170c222",
      "text": "这说明我完全融入了这部剧和角色之中嘛。\n你们两个前几天不也说过类似的话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ce6ed7030622a5633e4123e5481b513361bf4e3305f60423c5a54e6981ba60f",
      "text": "（……回到过去重新来过，吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_i:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0f706b9f5527b2d01aee0654eda3bce2945bec84ceff8e1cbdc8b25b0dc479d",
      "text": "（如果真的能做到那种事……\n我就要回到确定首飞日期的那一天）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bbe6b46bac12822f3d4a098f39fc54e84f9dd23f7dfebb90586f17406283bd8",
      "text": "（去请求别人，把日期换成另一天。\n把那一天的失败抹消掉……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_i:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70324f54ed19e7b50fccc1d0bc84fd1beebc8c65dd8289ff4c00ac5c4935dd91",
      "text": "（然后就这样回到现在的话……\n现在的我，是不是正作为飞行员大显身手呢……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_i:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d0bdc1e3346b71d2aeccd5c3bf56a4e11a80f86f9c5b198a9ecd75866cf0812",
      "text": "喂。如果真能像剧里演的那样\n回到过去，你们会怎么做？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_i:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a",
      "text": "哎……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:396bfc148c0211731ea8a1a87313f37099af16899c09b1d06bab538859e3a0a9",
      "text": "这个嘛。我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc2060c44898b4992984008835f0890f5aad69c47a5185c6ab6c3429989dc684",
      "text": "（即使能够从那一天逃开）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43eb3605db5c5f049c9e44eec0aec9b9ca7e30a152db97029acc02ef10a03f81",
      "text": "（在某处也必定会\n发生同样的事情吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4574224687e635f5acef902b009385ee94eebe3a5e04a1e2f588a17de02a596c",
      "text": "（然后……被仅仅一次的失败彻底击垮。\n在机场里，一直凝望着再也无法飞翔的天空）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4952e6db5a6b0d00dec507a4b94a8d5502919fb821cf766c785f7401f7fb9ea5",
      "text": "（……哪怕能改变过去，\n我自身的软弱也是不会改变的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_j:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14cb0904786f53c5ae201c55a1abbde79106f2ab358f6632da52c4ea6acb1993",
      "text": "（就算一时粉饰太平，\n终究也是无法欺骗自己的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4794c06fb2e4c0d2c846218e64d24d8c346fc780c604893c83e893be6aaf3ae",
      "text": "（既然如此……\n哪怕做好了受伤的准备，我也想要向前迈进）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:696c352aac3cd7964953e61d373c0594b4221ea86ee1bdc7840a6778ebb41aa1",
      "text": "（我想和在这里相遇的辉先生、薰先生一起，\n跨越任何挫折与失败！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_j:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e1336a1e86a335e2ae044891446bc0e95d84a0f4e351b0ca1e2e4959ee33b0",
      "text": "哪怕真的能回到过去，我也不会回去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_j:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9210cae3128ad664d282de079132bab43050a792a1019f42d25794ed920ad02",
      "text": "我想和大家3个人一起，继续朝前方走下去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87a2bb98c2c9d0b96c2647871ca378676622ca9d4c5839b34a5c344744540a1b",
      "text": "“真的想好了吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f168a76b33f626ee38228570646e89f8ff8803132593b5c1ec2495f4424617dd",
      "text": "“……回到原本的世界，\n再次去面对那些麻烦事和不安，谁都会抗拒啊”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f90570d3ec137e2ec9dca4ff6ee5ee3faf018f2dfeeb52eb633346be7a020e7e",
      "text": "“即便如此，在和老师聊过之后，我想起来了。\n我曾是那么憧憬着，想要成为像那个人一样的存在”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bb1c2e2a9526fad9b224ccedb5c414e4018b13a4489fbd35b66b5083971c28e",
      "text": "“见到了小时候的自己，\n我想要帮他实现那个梦想”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da898b8244e0538c5da1e7f391f7a5c194dcb7088b324625e11bf90130013105",
      "text": "“而且，能够替他实现梦想的，\n也就只有未来的我们了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9801b7cd28e5d8072e4900bdb41ce9ba8c36ec6a39e5d73ec3cb30de2d2d0542",
      "text": "“我可不想窝囊地在这里止步不前”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:570340a6257f6b14a88b93a7195f78a54b745d1a3cd2fead414818fbd9a37ca3",
      "text": "“……说得对。大家一起回去吧，回到原本的世界！\n为了能昂首挺胸，向小时候的自己报上名号！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecb440ad821da55738a3b13267fbaaaa8da057e07bed07a9fd8b0b9793c7dd4c",
      "text": "“诶？想借变身腰带？\n借你也不是不行啦……只能借一会儿哦！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e3b7c1c28142fc56b22094edaa1bd9ed5c87b94f569e004afdae82c97ae038c",
      "text": "“谢啦！你们将来，\n一定会成为帅气的大人的。不，是一定会让你们成为的！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1a05ea5294d9fa7dc845e2522030150c65cf9528945d896ed8012d5682d506e",
      "text": "“那么，走吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a18cfd6bc833efe4803d09bdefe0269f35d52f890fcaf8ae8f0a4124cda18bc4",
      "text": "“装备！星光变身！红色！\n在暮色中分外耀眼的一号星，参上！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000172:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d15232387261dcfee7bf6e7816c5a6c2e9f555b68acc4a4e8505035bf1bc303",
      "text": "终于杀青啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000174:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2",
      "text": "辛苦大家了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000174:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:174557cdddabc8f3ae1f024596d14b232827d1e3fd69041bca0d29659998ed9b",
      "text": "拍摄顺利结束了呢。\n辛苦大家了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000175:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:833bd5c8626af0fe0f9344864c18ae6434ebb1f0a6da7e2a6cbadf0a2ca850cb",
      "text": "能平安结束，\n真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000175:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf356eeb6720f6eac001346106339bc4231f3f2917c78c2c774a73dfc29f0e16",
      "text": "这次拍摄时间很长，\n能够平安结束真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000179:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91ba810ad2aedccc45eb0970ed8bda2a5b13411d47b6adac6a98ad2d84452002",
      "text": "嗯，制作人也\n辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000181:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c3bc1feb4f2bbef7d692ccfb0f26c4d23b0a5fc13b4aaaeaafcce8f0183ecc7",
      "text": "话说回来，这次的拍摄\n成了一个让我重新思考\n现状的好机会呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000183:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbc7c2be9e789d5426c916d119c66015cd84f9747629d378e50b281adf05a9bb",
      "text": "是啊。\n能够参加这次的拍摄，\n真的太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000185:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:686c5976eb39bb5ce2a98b3234a8b12eda29ba6cb211fc575e8867f028fff634",
      "text": "还有电视剧宣传的\n工作没做完呢。\n要做总结等那之后再说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000187:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acc0b5c924adf72704a8f1021d828a5b8d80e8882c86b9be28428c3ee86bc5ff",
      "text": "那么，等全都结束之后，\n大家一起开个总结会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000189:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6b58332c08c36b2c4d924ba32d6d13b84793d565b015447dc93350482fdf1ee",
      "text": "那样的话，我没意见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000191:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4af7a57e0c3f90f7d5a537151dc39ce919760516198d3480ca18435b6a905c4e",
      "text": "顺便就我们几个，\n稍微搞个\n庆功宴吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000193:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7955c04e510f18613977c9dcb6a1c956ba113785012b3eede11f70980773ddbb",
      "text": "庆功宴姑且不论，\n总结会制作人也要\n来参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000195:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62a3e713f13c252452c90a0003af6e8df6b7db6b60f36a41f4d1260909358f2e",
      "text": "好的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000195:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e09bbd18f6a160e35d637384ce8995532d7e77a3f2024788918f8bb6147a149e",
      "text": "明白了。让我们一起\n努力坚持到最后吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_k:cmd-000198:mobile_message:000": {
